Consistent with compared-counter diagnosis — no events ever entered this
peer's impulse/teleport queue.

## Path to close V5

Option A (preferred): re-run V5 with push/respawn targeting BOTH peers' Buddahs.
  - Host pushes CLIENT Buddah (client = owner) → client's motor will consume.
  - Client pushes HOST Buddah → host's motor will consume.
  - Ensure at least one respawn per peer (if possible — respawn routing depends
    on who triggers the death condition).
  - Each peer's cumulative counters should end > 0.

Option B: pull the HOST peer's log (Standalone Development Build's Player.log
or similar). Parity verdict for V5 must be per-peer; host may have passed on
its side.

