Despite the coverage miss, shadow parity on the paths that DID run (locomotion
only, on this peer) is clean: 8 heartbeats, loc-div=0 throughout, 0 fatal, 0
non-heartbeat D-LOC. Phase 3a locomotion shadow is re-confirmed working under
the new heartbeat format. Phase 3b impulse/teleport shadow was never exercised
on this peer and thus neither confirmed nor refuted.
